msgstr "Convert Kelvin to Fahrenheit for US engineering reviews when research papers quote absolute temperature but shop-floor instruments read °F. Aerospace and HVAC commissioning sometimes need this bridge. Use °F = K × 9/5 − 459.67."

#: src/features/convert/data/conversion-pair-content.ts:303
msgid "Convert kilograms to avoirdupois pounds for body weight, luggage, and gym plates when scales or airlines mix SI and US customary units. Shipping rate cards and protein powder tubs cross this pair constantly. One kilogram is about 2.20462 lb."
msgstr "Convert kilograms to avoirdupois pounds for body weight, luggage, and gym plates when scales or airlines mix SI and US customary units. Shipping rate cards and protein powder tubs cross this pair constantly. One kilogram is about 2.20462 lb."

#: src/features/convert/data/conversion-pair-content.ts:357
