msgstr "Convert kilograms to stone for body weight in the UK and Ireland, where stone remains common in conversation and some medical contexts. One stone is 14 avoirdupois pounds, exactly 6.35029318 kg. Athletes and clinics still quote stone and pounds together."

#: src/features/convert/data/conversion-pair-content.ts:61
