msgstr "Dual-label key sessions: “5:30 /km (8:51 /mile) ≈ 10.9 km/h (6.8 mph).” The first time takes a minute; the clarity lasts a season."

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:1230
msgid "Dual-label when audiences or regulations split across systems. Avoid cluttering specialist documents that already share one system—there, clear single-unit labelling is better."
msgstr "Dual-label when audiences or regulations split across systems. Avoid cluttering specialist documents that already share one system—there, clear single-unit labelling is better."

