msgstr "Proxima Centauri at about 4.25 ly is roughly 4.02×10¹³ km away. Saying that out loud shows why probes take decades even at high speed: kilometres make the gap concrete."

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:991
msgid "Publish millilitres alongside cups. Publish litres alongside gallons. Dual labelling is cheap compared with failed batches and angry comments."
msgstr "Publish millilitres alongside cups. Publish litres alongside gallons. Dual labelling is cheap compared with failed batches and angry comments."

