msgstr "The site is provided \"as is\" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. {0} does not guarantee uninterrupted availability, error-free pages, or suitability for a particular purpose. See our Terms of Service for full liability limits."

#: src/lib/units.ts:629
msgid "The square metre (m²) is the SI derived unit of area. Property listings, science, and engineering worldwide use it as the base area unit."
msgstr "The square metre (m²) is the SI derived unit of area. Property listings, science, and engineering worldwide use it as the base area unit."

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:427
msgid "The symbol matters: m means milli, M means mega. Writing Mm when you mean millimetre is a three-orders-of-magnitude disaster. Teach juniors to read symbols carefully before they trust a CAD export."
msgstr "The symbol matters: m means milli, M means mega. Writing Mm when you mean millimetre is a three-orders-of-magnitude disaster. Teach juniors to read symbols carefully before they trust a CAD export."

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:482
msgid "The symbol µ (mu) means micro (10⁻⁶). The symbol m means milli (10⁻³) when used as a prefix. They differ by a factor of one thousand."
msgstr "The symbol µ (mu) means micro (10⁻⁶). The symbol m means milli (10⁻³) when used as a prefix. They differ by a factor of one thousand."

